/// Session 13 Batch 3D-S encrypted identity envelope versions. Binary layout
/// is nonce_12 || ciphertext || tag_16 in one restricted BYTEA column.
/// Rotation inserts a new row and retains the prior readable envelope.
/// SQL enforces at most one `current` and one `rotation_pending` per
/// observation, and a deferred exactly-one-current rule unless every
/// envelope is cryptographically erased. Legal hold blocks BYTEA redaction.
/// Model B purge may null the BYTEA under erasure authority. No plaintext
/// provider identity. Public reads must omit protectedIdentityEnvelope and
/// opaqueKeyAlias. Database access is not decryption authority.
